ds home, despite objections from a critic living in Australia. The planning approval comes with conditions, including a ban on motorised boats and restrictions on firepit use during bird-nesting season at the estate.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/david-and-victoria-beckham-win-planning-battle-for-blackpool-style-lights-hot-tub-and-firepit-at-6-15m-cotswolds-home-despite-australia-based-critic/articleshow/133301663.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/david-and-victoria-beckham-win-planning-battle-for-blackpool-style-lights-hot-tub-and-firepit-at-6-15m-cotswolds-home-despite-australia-based-critic/articleshow/133301663.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-17T22:09:06+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133301842,imgsize-145910.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Meet ex-Tesla engineer Saiman Shetty who became American citizen through EB-1 Green Card: 'That one decision gave me freedom']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133301932.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-ex-tesla-engineer-saiman-shetty-who-became-american-citizen-through-eb-1-green-card-that-one-decision-gave-me-freedom/articleshow/133301932.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/meet-ex-tesla-engineer-saiman-shetty-who-became-american-citizen-through-eb-1-green-card-that-one-decision-gave-me-freedom/articleshow/133301932.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-17T22:16:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133301997,imgsize-44460.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[30 lions and tigers leave notorious Argentine zoo; head to new sanctuaries]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133295851.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Thirty lions and tigers from Argentina’s shuttered Lujan Zoo have begun a major relocation to wildlife sanctuaries in South Africa and the US. Led by Four Paws, the rescue involves moving 30 big cats that spent years in cramped cages and suffered health problems. The animals will now travel to Lionsrock in South Africa and The Wild Animal Sanctuary in Colorado.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/30-lions-and-tigers-spent-years-in-cramped-concrete-cages-at-a-notorious-argentine-zoo-they-are-now-beginning-a-journey-to-sanctuaries-where-they-can-finally-roam-freely/articleshow/133295851.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/30-lions-and-tigers-spent-years-in-cramped-concrete-cages-at-a-notorious-argentine-zoo-they-are-now-beginning-a-journey-to-sanctuaries-where-they-can-finally-roam-freely/articleshow/133295851.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-17T22:06:10+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133298371,imgsize-119602.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Only nine such butterflies were found in US in 2022; 3 years later, over 1,300 were released]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133273631.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Researchers in Michigan have helped bring the Poweshiek skipperling butterfly back from the brink of extinction after its US wild population fell to just nine in 2022. Through captive breeding, habitat restoration and carefully planned releases, more than 1,300 butterflies were released in 2025. The recovery effort has now expanded to other endangered butterflies, while restored prairie habitats are helping support wider ecosystems.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/only-nine-of-these-butterflies-were-found-across-the-us-in-2022-three-years-later-researchers-released-more-than-1300-to-rebuild-the-species/articleshow/133273631.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/only-nine-of-these-butterflies-were-found-across-the-us-in-2022-three-years-later-researchers-released-more-than-1300-to-rebuild-the-species/articleshow/133273631.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-17T22:06:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Science Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133273868,imgsize-77383.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Wildfire came within metres of rescued orangutans; 60 animals moved]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/133276001.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/wildfires-came-within-metres-of-rescued-orangutans-in-indonesia-staff-fought-the-blaze-into-the-night-and-moved-60-animals-to-safer-enclosures/articleshow/133276001.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/wildfires-came-within-metres-of-rescued-orangutans-in-indonesia-staff-fought-the-blaze-into-the-night-and-moved-60-animals-to-safer-enclosures/articleshow/133276001.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-17T20:40:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133276037,imgsize-73038.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian Jazz musician Pritesh Walia released from ICE custody after 14 