 sources were utilised.  The findings point to wider technological connections with the Islamic world through maritime trade.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/archaeologists-find-earliest-physical-evidence-of-brass-making-in-east-asia-in-southern-china/articleshow/133294697.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/china/archaeologists-find-earliest-physical-evidence-of-brass-making-in-east-asia-in-southern-china/articleshow/133294697.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-08-17T20:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-133294866,imgsize-131000.cms"/></item></channel></rss>